## Decisions and Action Items

* **Comparative Analysis of QUIC-CL Drafts**: The research group agreed to conduct an exhaustive comparative evaluation between the DLR/Univ. of Bologna QUIC-CL proposal (`draft-caini-tsvwg-quic-dtn-dtn-cl`) and alternative convergence layer specifications (such as Alira's QUIC-CL proposal) to inform future IETF transport standardization.
* **Alignment with 3GPP SA3/RAN2**: Establish liaison and coordination points between SPACE RG and 3GPP SA3 (Security Area 11 / TR 23.801) regarding NTN security assumptions, high propagation delay timers, and disaggregated RAN transport boundaries.
* **Constellation Schema Standardization**: Advance community work on standardized constellation topology representation schemas using CDDL (`draft-tchilinguirian-space-constellation-cddl`) within SPACE RG.

